5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good day, everyone. I believe a quiet and observant start is best for us all. Let us see how the conversation unfolds naturally.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can be kind to one another while we search for the truth together.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with Jonathan. Since we have no data, we should focus on observing behavioral patterns and logical consistency.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited! I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf. Let's all be honest and friendly!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,A simple enough start. I'll be watching to see who tries to manipulate the group's direction too early.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, your enthusiasm is refreshing. However, we must remember that friendliness can sometimes be a mask in this game.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, Jonathan, let us not be too cynical. A warm heart can be a great strength when we need to trust each other.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Trust is a luxury, Shizue. I'm more interested in how people react to pressure. @Shion, you seem very confident; do you have a strategy?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not masking anything! I just want us all to get along! But I'll be careful, I promise!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,My strategy is simple: I observe the gaps between words and intentions. I prefer to let others reveal themselves first.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,A cautious approach is indeed the most prudent. I shall continue to listen and reflect on our interactions.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,"I believe that if we listen with sincerity, the truth will reveal itself in time. I trust in the goodness of this group.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Sincerity is subjective. I will be looking for contradictions. If anyone's logic shifts tomorrow, I will point it out.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! But I guess that's how we win! I'll try to be a super-detective too!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, I admire your rigor. It will be interesting to see if your logic can pierce through a well-crafted lie.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we have established our initial stances. I shall retire for the evening.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Shizue,,I wish you all a peaceful night's sleep. Please take care of yourselves.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I will be analyzing today's dialogue. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Kenji,,Goodnight! I hope the Seer finds something really helpful tonight! See you tomorrow!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,A quiet night awaits. I look forward to seeing the masks slip tomorrow.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
