36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good morning. The first night has passed. I wonder if our Seer has found any clarity to share with us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. I am curious if there is any news that can guide us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Now that the Seer has information, the dynamic changes. If the Seer is confident, speaking now could save us time.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Good morning! Um... I actually have some really important news! I'm the Seer, and I found the werewolf! It's Shion!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That was fast. To claim the Seer role and point a finger immediately is a very bold move, Kenji.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, such a direct revelation is risky. If you are the Seer, you've exposed yourself. If you aren't, this is a blatant attack.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, this is quite a shock. Shion, do you have anything to say in your defense, dear?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, why reveal yourself so early? Usually, a Seer waits to ensure their survival. This feels uncharacteristically impulsive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I just couldn't keep it a secret! I wanted to help everyone right away! Shion is definitely the wolf!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,It's a classic deception. The werewolf often claims the Seer role to eliminate a target and gain trust. I am merely a villager.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"We have a direct conflict. One is the Seer, the other is the wolf, or both are lying. We must weigh the probabilities.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is so sad to see such accusations so soon. I want to believe Kenji's honesty, but Shion is so calm.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, if you are a villager, you have no evidence to counter Kenji other than ""it's a classic deception."" That is not a logical proof.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"See! Asuka gets it! I'm telling the truth! Please, we have to vote for Shion!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the proof is in the timing. A real Seer would be more calculating. Kenji's ""honesty"" is a convenient cover for a wolf's aggression.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Given the evidence, Kenji's claim is the only concrete lead we have, however risky it was. I will follow the lead.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I feel very conflicted, but Kenji seemed so sincere when he spoke. I will trust him this time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I find the timing suspicious, but Shion's defense is purely rhetorical. Logically, the Seer's claim is the primary lead.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Thank you everyone! I knew you'd believe me! Let's get the wolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Shion,,A pity. You've all chosen to believe a child's act over a calm observation. Very well.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
